  m_Name: Page_03_Tsunami_Comms
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CivilGame.Book.ManualPageData
  _leftPageTitle: 'THREAT: TSUNAMI'
  _leftPageIllustration: {fileID: 0}
  _leftPageContent: 'There is one particular danger at sea: the tsunami.



    A tsunami usually occurs following an earthquake; in the initial phase, the water recedes sharply from the coastline.



    If you see a wave that obscures the horizon, the resulting destruction will be catastrophic.



    The only way to avert such a disaster is to call divers. '
  _rightPageTitle: COMMUNICATIONS AND SUPPLY
  _rightPageIllustration: {fileID: 0}
  _rightPageContent: 'As you can see, there is a telephone on the table nearby; it will allow you to contact headquarters and the supply store.



    For every successful prevention, you will receive a reward that you can spend at the store.



    Good luck!'
  _pageNumberText: 
